<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch economic indicators week of July 21.</title>
<headline>Dutch economic indicators week of July 21.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>  GMT----date---indicator------------period---previous</p>
<p>  0730  24/07   GDP growth (final)   Q1	 prov. +2.1 pct</p>
<p>  0730  24/07   consumer spending    May	April +3.7 pct</p>
<p>  0730  25/07   consumer confidence  July     June 16 (unch.)</p>
<p>  0730  25/07   trade balance	  April    March +NLG 2.9 bln</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
